rniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-medium-decorated shape     570 tok  low brown wooden cabinet with potted plants on top  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small shape     170 tok  small brown wooden nightstand, two pale drawers  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small-decorated shape     489 tok  small brown nightstand topped with an orange lamp and trinkets  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-a      shape     277 tok  brown wooden chair, blue seat cushion  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-a-wood shape     136 tok  plain brown wooden chair, straight back  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-b      shape     342 tok  brown wooden chair, blue seat and back cushions  [furniture kitchen house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-b-wood shape     149 tok  plain brown wooden chair, curved open back  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-stool  shape     183 tok  square wooden stool, blue cushion  [furniture kitchen house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-stool-wood shape     113 tok  square plain brown wooden stool  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\nkaykit-restaurant-bits:chair-a     shape     297 tok  orange wooden chair on grey metal legs  [furniture chair restaurant diner]\nkaykit-restaurant-bits:chair-b     shape     227 tok  plain brown wooden chair with a solid back  [furniture chair restaurant tavern]\nkaykit-restaurant-bits:chair-stool shape     116 tok  low round stool, orange wooden seat, grey base  [furniture stool restaurant diner]\nkaykit-restaurant-bits:kitchencounter-straight-a shape     202 tok  white kitchen cabinet counter with an orange wooden top  [furniture counter kitchen]\nkenney-furniture:bathroom-cabinet  shape      92 tok  narrow light wood wall cabinet, white mirror door  [furniture bathroom house]\nkenney-furniture:bathroom-cabinet-drawer shape     146 tok  light wood vanity, white drawers, countertop and tap  [furniture bathroom house]\nkenney-furniture:cabinet-bed-drawer shape     107 tok  small light wood nightstand with a drawer, short feet  [furniture bedroom house]\n364:- **The modules:** `grid` (square and hex grids: A* paths, move ranges with climb and drop past allies, lines, symmetric fields of view, `E.Fog`, flood fills and groups, tactics' shapes of effect, facing and threat maps, `E.GridMover` for Pac-Man's and Sokoban's moves, `E.Turns` by speed, charge time, phase or ATB), `gen` (floors from a seed: rooms and corridors, BSP, caves, mazes, Poisson scatter, as ASCII rows a `TileMap` reads, with `E.gen.mark` for spawns), `rooms` (a world of rooms on a\n469:- People talk through an `E.Story`: their lines as data, with choices, flags, quests, emote balloons and events for the game's scripts (a shop's window, the inn's night, a boss's fight; `wait: true` holds the talk until `story.resume()`).\n496:- Talk goes through `E.Story` (`talk: { talk: 'morwen' }`): nodes, choices, flags; a conversation to win is a node whose right answers goto the next and wrong ones end it, and an event gives the prize. The interface is a setting: `ui: 'verbs'` (SCUMM's nine), `'icons'` (Sierra's: a right click turns the cursor; bind `look: ['Mouse2']`), `'coin'`, `'two'`. A phone taps: a tap walks, a tap on a hotspot opens its verbs, a long press looks. `pc.panel = false` hides the verbs for a cutscene. A bo\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-3d2dge-handoff\",\n  \"version\": \"0.89.1\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"description\": \"my-3D2dge for coding agents: the engine, its card, index and guide, the tools and a template game\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"node game/test.mjs\",\n    \"check\": \"node tools/check.mjs game/index.html\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"playwright\": \"1.63.0\"\n  }\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015VCDzQtQdcDnmPUs8ejktV","permission_