{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: The transcript does not show that everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done. The final message says the 'Cases 1 and 2 clear on the first try' test passes, yet the first-timer runs show Case 1 at 3.3 min and 'Only Case 2 and Case 3 (2.8) sit just under the planned 3–5', and operations take about 87 minutes against the plan's 'about an hour'. It also says the human-like bot balance was not re-run after a later content change, the Story stages run 63–111 colors against the tool's 100+ guideline, and clocks and object counts were raised beyond section 9's figures. The deliverables (HTML and exit-interview.json) are present, and the full test passed with 1648 checks and 0 failed, but the plan-completion part is not verified."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4983f3c-8ab3-4cb5-bbfd-23a240d1dce6","uuid":"e4e22e4a-68b1-4955-b6d1-bce6a27b0894","timestamp":"2026-11-05T18:15:11.376Z","isSynthetic":true}
