{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkWTs1v4DusCFoLG6t8c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Second Scalpel is complete, and the audit above now puts the evidence on the record.** PLAN.md is verified section by section, and the file in the folder is unchanged (hash `b4f9a8058473`). This round only added tests and audit text. The fast suite passes with them (1719 checks, 0 failed), and the last full run of this same game file passed (1779 checks, 0 failed).\n\n**Still partly code-read:** two small items in that audit, Grand Rounds awards and standings (also checked in a screenshot), and attract starting from Case Files and the Lobby (also tested from the title and menu).\n\n**Nothing further can be done on this computer:**\n- **A person playing it:** hand feel, difficulty and the sound mix need someone with a real controller. TASK.md says those are \"checked as far as it can be here, never required\", and the stand-ins it names are in use.\n- **\"About an hour\":** this is a calculation from first-timer bot runs plus story, ward and chart timings. A real number needs a real player.\n\nI won't make more changes just to answer the same objections, because each extra edit risks breaking a build that has been verified; my retry fix did exactly that earlier. If the stop check keeps blocking on those two points, the goal can't be met by any further work here, so ending it is your call.\n\nSource Information, the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback, and the file list are all in my previous message and unchanged; they are also in the in-game About screen and `exit-interview.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4568,"cache_read_input_tokens":766754,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4568},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","spe