{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MBv8WMoS6SeFSxwJng2cJz","type":"tool_result","content":"--- TASK.md\n50:No script can check these, so they're written by hand. Test with the stand-ins; anything that needs the real thing is checked as far as it can be here, never required.\n52:- **No physical controller.** Emulate one: replace navigator.getGamepads with a stub that returns a pad in the standard mapping (Playwright's add_init_script / addInitScript).\n54:- **Nobody to listen.** Check sound by what Web Audio produces: render it with an OfflineAudioContext, or read levels from an AnalyserNode.\n56:- **No real iPhone or iPad.** WebKit with an iPhone profile is the closest; it isn't iOS Safari.\n57:- **No TV.** Judge the 10-foot view from screenshots at 1920×1080.\n--- PLAN.md on people\n290:**Balance targets at Resident.** A first-time player clears Cases 1 and 2 first try, fails Case 3 once or twice, needs 2 to 4 tries on Tremolo and 3 to 6 on the Canto\n427:A first clear runs about an hour on Resident: eleven cases of 3 to 5 minutes each, plus story and ward. Numbers are Resident defaults, to be balanced with the bot and\n1026:| M1 | **Hands:** sim core, tissue painter, cursor, wheel, Forceps, Salve, Suture, Syringe, vitals, clock, grades, HUD, Results, Case 1 end to end, bot | A person wo\n1295:**Harness runner.** The folder needs the game (as `game.html`) and copies of `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js`. It uses an OS-picked port, checks the frame's t\n--- this machine\nDISPLAY=''\nls: cannot access '/dev/input': No such file or directory\ntimer\n/bin/bash: line 1: lsusb: command not found\n--- audit, code-read marks\n0\n--- deliverables\na 1682611 14:55 SecondScalpel-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105\na    5715 14:55 exit-interview.json\nae625e5091de\nexit interview parses","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4983f3c-8ab3-4cb5-bbfd-23a240d1dce6","uuid":"dbe23336-ca11-45db